y inner evil loose again. In a moment of uncontrollable rage, I took the life of another and now I'm tormented by the guilt of my actions.\n\nI come to you, my spiritual family, to ask atone my sins and to help the victim's shadow reach peace on the other side.\n\nLet us live in peace in the realm of shadows,\n\nHietala": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement A/Tenement A Elevator Fuses.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Tenement A elevator fuses": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Notice!\n\n1: Call Buttons \n2: Engine\n3: Controls\n4: Lights\n\nP.S. If you need help you can find me on the top floor.": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement A/Tenement A Elevator.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Tenement A elevator": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Notice!\n\nElevator is out of service, electrician has been dispatched to troubleshoot the issue.": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Ambience": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Stove": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Wood": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Pipe": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "People and stuff": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Random noise": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Random": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Sad dog": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Water pipe": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Talking": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Talking 2": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Lamp": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets6.assets"]}, "Lamp 2": {"Soundscape:loopS